 a plain modern narrator takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"over on the turn after a re-voiced one, which is exactly the defect the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Dungeon and Zork 1 floors were written to close. Naming each verb in a test","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catches that; it does not catch a ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forty-eighth"}]},{"text":" stub arriving in the engine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tomorrow, which would slip past every named assertion at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"So this reads the properties off ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameText.StubReplies"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mirror"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than listing them: every line the engine actually ships is compared,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and one added tomorrow is compared the day it lands. A property whose type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this cannot render is reported as its own issue rather than skipped, which is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what keeps “reflected” from quietly meaning “unchecked”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"That last sentence has no exception to it as of #246. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"give"},{"text":" used to be one:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the one line about two objects, so not a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameText.Line"},{"text":", so unreachable by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reflection and compared by hand below the loop — the single line in here that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"could change shape without the sweep noticing. It takes a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameText.Gift"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now, and goes through the same door as the other forty-eight.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Which sentences each line prints is the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"subject’s"}]},{"text":" business as of #255:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LineSubject.samples(one:many:)"},{"text":" supplies them, so a subject arriving","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tomorrow is swept the day it lands rather than after somebody teaches a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"switch here about it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It is split out from ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectNoEngineStubLineSurvives(in:game:sourceLocation:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the sweep can be tested for being ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"alive"}]},{"text":": a reflection loop that matches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing passes silently, where one asserted to see all forty-nine lines","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cannot.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustotestsupport\/enginevoicedstublines(in:)"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Asserting","title":"Asserting","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectInOrder(_:_:sourceLocation:)","doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectEveryNounAnswered(_:_:sourceLocation:)","doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectNoAmbiguity(_:_:sourceLocation:)","doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/Gn